009200 01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN                PIC S9(4)  VALUE ZERO COMP-4.
009300 01  FIELD-NUMBER                  PIC S9(4)  VALUE 1    COMP-4.
009400 01  ADD-DATE-DBUFLEN              PIC S9(4)  VALUE 145 COMP-4.
